INSERT INTO blog_post_translations
  (post_id, locale, slug, title, excerpt, body_html, seo_title, seo_description)
VALUES (
  :post_id, 'en', $x$telegram-stars-uzbekistan$x$,
  $x$Telegram Stars: what they are and how to buy them in Uzbekistan$x$,
  $x$What Telegram Stars are, what to spend them on and how to buy them in Uzbekistan in soʻm: by username, no password and no foreign card.$x$,
$x$<h2>Key takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>Telegram Stars are Telegram's in-app currency. They pay bots and mini apps, paid posts, channel subscriptions and gifts.</li>
<li>Stars are for one-off purchases. Telegram Premium is a subscription to features of the app itself.</li>
<li>Inside the app, Stars are sold through the App Store, Google Play or @PremiumBot, priced in the store's currency.</li>
<li>On YuPay you buy Stars by @username, from 50 to 15,000, and pay in soʻm with Click, Payme or Uzum.</li>
</ul>
<p>You can buy Telegram Stars in Uzbekistan without a foreign card: you pay in soʻm and the Stars land on your account by username. Below: what the currency is, what to spend it on and how to buy it.</p>
<h2>What Telegram Stars are</h2>
<p>Telegram Stars are a balance inside your Telegram account. Telegram launched them on 6 June 2024 as a single way to pay for digital goods inside the app (<a href="https://telegram.org/blog/telegram-stars">Telegram blog</a>).</p>
<p>Stars belong to the account, not the device. New phone or desktop login — same balance.</p>
<p>Where Stars are spent:</p>
<ul>
<li>purchases from bots and mini apps: service features, items in mini games;</li>
<li>paid posts in channels: locked photos and videos;</li>
<li>subscriptions to private channels;</li>
<li>Star reactions to support creators;</li>
<li>gifts to other users, including Telegram Premium.</li>
</ul>
<p>One limit: a regular user cannot cash Stars back out. Buy as many as you plan to spend.</p>
<h2>What to spend Stars on</h2>
<p><strong>Gifts.</strong> Pick a gift, pay in Stars and send it in a chat. The gift stays on the recipient's profile.</p>
<p><strong>Paid content.</strong> A creator locks a post or opens a channel by subscription for Stars. That is how courses and creator communities get paid.</p>
<p><strong>Bots and mini apps.</strong> Stars buy extended service features and items in mini games. It works like game currency, only inside Telegram itself.</p>
<p><strong>Star reactions.</strong> A small tip to the author right under the post, no separate transfer.</p>
<h2>How to buy Telegram Stars in soʻm on YuPay</h2>
<p>Inside Telegram, Stars are bought through the App Store, Google Play or @PremiumBot. The price is in the store's currency and you need a card the store accepts. Many people in Uzbekistan do not have one.</p>
<p>On YuPay you pay in soʻm:</p>
<ol>
<li>Open the <a href="/en/store/telegram-stars">Telegram Stars page</a>.</li>
<li>Enter your Telegram @username (Settings → Username).</li>
<li>Choose the amount: 50 to 15,000 Stars.</li>
<li>Pay with Click, Payme or Uzum.</li>
</ol>
<p>The Stars are credited to the account automatically. The total in soʻm is shown before you pay, and that is exactly what is charged.</p>
<p>No password and no login code — only the public username. Check it before paying: the Stars go to the account you entered.</p>
<h2>Stars or Premium</h2>
<p>These are two different products.</p>
<p><strong>Stars</strong> are for specific purchases: a gift, a post, a mini-game item, a bot feature. You pay for what you take, and the balance does not expire.</p>
<p><strong>Premium</strong> is a 3, 6 or 12-month subscription. It removes ads, raises upload limits and adds interface features. Details in <a href="/en/blog/telegram-premium">Telegram Premium in Uzbekistan</a>.</p>
<p>Both can be gifted. Stars the recipient spends on their own; Premium is a ready subscription for a set term.</p>
<h2>If the Stars do not show up</h2>
<p>Open Settings → My Stars in Telegram: the balance is there. If it is empty, check the username in the order. If it is correct, contact YuPay support with the order number from your email.</p>
<h2>Where to start</h2>
<p>Work out how many Stars your purchase needs. Open <a href="/en/store/telegram-stars">Telegram Stars on YuPay</a>, enter your @username and pay in soʻm.</p>$x$,
  $x$Telegram Stars in Uzbekistan: what they are and how to buy$x$,
  $x$What Telegram Stars are and what they buy. How to get Stars in Uzbekistan by username: pay in soʻm with Click, Payme or Uzum, no foreign card needed.$x$
);

